.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH rev-stealth-config-show 1  "rev-stealth-config-show " 
.SH NAME
rev\-stealth\-config\-show \- Print the merged effective config from all 4 source layers (policy.toml / authorized.toml / sites/* / env). Secret\-looking env values are replaced with `<redacted>`
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBrev\-stealth config show\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Print the merged effective config across the 4 source layers (policy.toml / authorized.toml / sites/* / env). Secret\-looking env values are replaced with `<redacted>`.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.SH EXTRA
EXAMPLES:
  $ rev\-stealth config show
  $ rev\-stealth config \-\-output\-format json show
  $ rev\-stealth config \-\-output\-format yaml show

EXIT CODES:
  0  Ok               Config emitted.
  1  UserError        Bad args / parse error.
  3  PermanentError   Config IO failure.

ENV:
  REV_SCRAPING_HOME        Override `~/.rev_scraping/` base.
  REV_SCRAPING_POLICY      Override the policy.toml path.
  REV_SCRAPING_AUTHORIZED  Override the authorized.toml path.
